  "solution": "**Given: **52 + 69 - 46 ÷ 23 × 26 = 20\n\nInterchanging the numbers and using BODMAS rule:\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) → 46 and 23\n\n⇒ 52 + 69 - **23 ÷ 46**__ × 26 = 20\n\n⇒ 52 + 69 - __**0.5 × 26**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**52 + 69**__ -13 = 20\n\n⇒ __**121 -13**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 108 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n•",
